    ],
    "text": "Notice under Section 7",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.020000457763672,
      10.979999542236328
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.76,
      369.71,
      286.6,
      440.34
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as Amended by the land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land/Servitude which is required for a public purpose .",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.020000457763672,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.76,
      441.14,
      286.51,
      536.76
    ],
    "text": "Description of the Land or Servitude to be acquired : Under mention land is situated at Nerakkudah Kandam Koduvamadu Grama Niladhari Division in Eravur Pattu Divisional Secretariat Batticaloa in Eastern Province and is Preliminary Plan was perpared by Survey general and details in PP/BA/2591 and extend of 0.0840.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.019999980926514,
      10.020000457763672,
      13.979999542236328
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.76,
      538.07,
      286.52,
      598.2
    ],
    "text": "Lot No. 01 \u2014 Name of Land: Nerakkudah Kandam; Usage at present: Chenai Cultivation; Claimant: Mrs. Jeyamalini Logitharajah; Extent: 0.0840 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.020000457763672,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      333.85,
      539.45,
      367.92
    ],
    "text": "North: PP 99488 and Lot 3 in PP A515; East: Lots 3 and 6 in PP A515; South: Lot 6 in PP A515 and Aru; West: TP 99488.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      368.19,
      541.99,
      539.82
    ],
    "text": "All person interested in the aforesaid land/lands on which a servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before at Eravurpattu. On the 05th day of August on 2015 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 06th day of July 2015 the nature of their interests in the land, the Particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount. U. UTHAYASHRITHER, Divisional Secretary, Eravurpattu.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.980000019073486,
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
